# 0.1.24: Wrench aim help from the side (a tester on 0.1.23: "It should activate on release. It should become more aggressive
# overall, particularly when swinging the wrench from the side or at an angle"). As wrenchhelp.sim (Novalis's first crates,
# QUEST_SIM_NEAR=500 QUEST_SIM_NEAR_AT=6,0.5,60 QUEST_WRENCH_TRACE=1, --level 1), the head facing the crates, but the stroke
# goes across the body, right to left (35 cm in about 70 ms, 5 cm forward): a side swing let go at its end, the throw about
# 80 degrees left of where the head looks. With Strong help (the start) or Very strong: "[vr-wrench] thrown at N m/s where
# the hand threw ... aim help to class N (Strong, where the head looks)", the crate looked at "broken". With Light
# (wrench_aim_help 1, 0.1.23's) or Off (wrench_aim_help 0): no help, the throw goes left.
